       title="Shortcuts - Report" id="Shortcuts-Report">

    <note>The release of Alibre Version 28 required some changes to the shortcuts code base that are incompatible with earlier versions of Alibre.
        Alibre V28 is supported in Utilities For Alibre Version 3.0. Alibre V27 is supported in Utilities For Alibre Version 2.1.</note>
    <p>This tool provides a simple report of assigned shortcuts. Select the drop-down to change the editor profile.</p>
